      "description": "Feast Book is a simple, offline table reservation manager for restaurants.\nTake bookings — guest, party size, date, time, table and deposit — run today's\nservice, and keep your tables and numbers in order. No account, no sign-up, and\nno internet connection required. Everything is saved privately on your own\ndevice.\n\nAdd a booking in seconds with the guest, the party size, the date and time and\nthe table you'd like to seat them at. Feast Book keeps every reservation with a\nclear status and shows you the deposit held.\n\nThe Today screen lays out the day's service in time order, so the front desk\nalways knows who's next. Seat guests when they arrive and complete each booking\nwith a single tap. The Tables screen keeps your dining tables — seats and area —\nand shows how many bookings each one has today.\n\nThe Reports screen turns your book into clear numbers: total covers served,\nreservations, deposits held, completed and cancelled counts, bookings by day of\nthe week and covers by area — so you can see your busiest nights at a glance.\n\nMade for restaurants, cafés and bistros that want a fast, private, paper-free\nway to manage table reservations.\n\nKey features:\n- Table bookings with guest, party size, date, time and deposit\n- Assign bookings to your dining tables\n- Today's service view with seat and complete actions\n- Booked → Seated → Completed status, plus cancellations\n- Covers-by-area and busiest-day reports\n- 100% offline — your data never leaves the device\n- No login, no ads, no tracking",
